<BaseLayout title="Close the day with the records together." description="Sales, receipts, outstanding balances and stock movements in one operating view.">
<PageHero eyebrow="The Kora product plan" title="Close the day with the records together." lede="Sales, receipts, outstanding balances and stock movements in one operating view." />
<section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-14 prose-kora">
<h2>Sales are not the same as money received</h2>
<p>A confirmed order may still be unpaid. A paid order may still be awaiting dispatch. Reports should show those differences, along with cash recorded by staff and provider-verified payments.</p>
<h2>See the cost behind a sale</h2>
<p>Basic purchase-cost tracking can support indicative gross-margin reports. Incomplete opening costs or unrecorded expenses limit what those figures mean. This is not a complete accounting system.</p>
<h2>Give your accountant useful records</h2>
<p>Export order references, recorded payments, refunds and stock history for review. Tax filing, statutory accounts and a multi-client accountant portal are outside the first MVP.</p>
<p><a href="/pilot" class="btn btn-primary">Explore the founding pilot</a></p>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
